+// Streaming MP3s can only have a single active instance (Ruffle `start`:
+// `if is_streaming { stop_sound(previous instance) }`). Non-streaming loaded
+// sounds keep stacking instances, which is what sound_load_multiple_instances
+// pins.
+static void soundStartExternalPlayback(ASObject* sound_obj, double duration_ms)
+{
